    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 189",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The leader of the devils trying to occupy the Tower of Insolence. He strives to obtain the secret knowledge hidden in the Tower of Insolence and use it as a bridgehead to expand the power of devils. But he expended too much power trying to break a seal of the Tower, and is now weak. He is enemies with the angels and the Platinum tribe protecting the Tower of Insolence at the command of Einhasad. He has three loyal subordinates: Kernon, Rahha, and Verfa. Undead Lv. 1 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Undead. HP Recovery +10% Received P. Crit. Rate -5 Received Critical Damage -5% Received M. Crit. Damage -5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +3% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Holy -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
